// Title: Potential SmadHook.DLL Sideloading
// Rule ID: 24b6cf51-6122-469e-861a-22974e9c1e5b
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
